  "description": "\"Tale of Gyeryong Fairy\" also called \"Mama Fairy And The Woodcutter\" is a webtoon telling the story of a woman fairy that lived in Goryeo and Joseon, she is now a 'barista'. She is waiting for her husband to reincarnate to be able to get her winged clothing back.\n\nOriginal Webtoon: [Naver Comic](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list.nhn?titleId=693431), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.nhn?productNo=2678871)\n\nOfficial Translations:  \n[S.Chinese ](https://www.dongmanmanhua.cn/LOVE/jilongxiannvzhan/list?title_no=1305)",
